_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601570/extras/dream.gif?t=1744108005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the clues you\u2019ve gathered <strong>within dreams</strong> <br>and find the true culprit behind your mentor\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Brutal Yet Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601570/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c_en.png?t=1744108005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Converse with <strong>eight \u2018La\u2019s\u2019</strong>, build rapport, and gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601570/extras/\ub77c\ud30c\uc5d8\ub77c_\uc2dc\uacc4.gif?t=1744108005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But never forget\u2014<strong>they cannot be trusted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong> <br>Find the real \u2018La\u2019 and decide how this story ends.</p>","developers":["Black Tangerine"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2524200","name":"KILLA"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601570/b94a896c0601d66ef2f40b16b1aaa6ac4368b177/header.jpg?t=1744108005","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The demo version can be streamed in all aspects.</h2><br>Sharing, leakage, modification, distribution, and sales are prohibited other than personal play.<br>If you violate this, you are liable.<br><br>twitter : @Kill_the_LA<br>instagram : @Kill_the_LA<br>E-Mail : <a href=\"mailto:killa4office@gmail.com\">killa4office@gmail.com</a>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121841,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.s